{'symbol': 'FDX', 'date': '2022-03-30 08:00:00', 'title': 'FEDEX PLANS TO TEST AUTONOMOUS DRONE CARGO DELIVERY WITH ELROY AIR', 'text': "MEMPHIS, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FEDEX EXPRESS, A SUBSIDIARY OF FEDEX CORP. (NYSE: FDX) AND THE WORLD'S LARGEST EXPRESS TRANSPORTATION COMPANY, IS TEAMING UP WITH CALIFORNIA BAY AREA-BASED ELROY AIR, THE COMPANY BUILDING THE FIRST END-TO-END AUTONOMOUS VERTICAL TAKE-OFF AND LANDING (VTOL) AERIAL CARGO SYSTEM. AS A FIRST OF ITS KIND AGREEMENT IN THE U.S., FEDEX EXPRESS WILL DEVELOP PLANS TO TEST ELROY AIR'S CHAPARRAL AUTONOMOUS AIR CARGO SYSTEM WITHIN THE COMPANY'S MIDDLE-MILE LOGISTICS OPERATIO"}